    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5412" root="جر" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَجَرٌّ</span></b>  [The <i>place,</i> or <i>track, along which a thing
is,</i> or <i>has been, dragged,</i> or <i>drawn</i>]. You say,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَأَيْتُ مَجَرَّ ذَيْلِهِ</span> [<i>I saw the track along which his
hinder skirt had been dragged</i>]. (A.) See also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المَجَرَّةُ</span>: and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَارٌّ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>A place of pasture.</i> (TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  The <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَائِز</span> [or <i>beam</i>] <i>upon which are placed
the extremities of the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَوَارِض</span> [or <i>rafters</i>]. (K)

